{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00034","headline":"初夏 · 太宗皇帝","name":"初夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一朝春夏改，隔夜鸟花迁。\n阴阳深浅叶，晓夕重轻烟。\n哢鸎犹响殿，横丝正网天。\n佩高兰影接，绶细草纹连。\n碧鳞惊櫂侧，玄燕舞檐前。\n何必汾阳处，始复有山泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}